  "bodyHash": "c160f060692cb092",
  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/bagofholding/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/bagofholding/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;line-height:36px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flunapixel.studio%252fdiscord\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Discord&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white\" width=\"117\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fx.com%252fFusseel\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Twitter&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=x&logoColor=white\" width=\"116\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@heyitsfuzs\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=YouTube&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=youtube&logoColor=white\" width=\"118\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Fuzss\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=GitHub&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=github&logoColor=white\" width=\"108\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/fuzs_\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=CurseForge&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&logoColor=white\" width=\"143\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fFuzs\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Modrinth&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth&logoColor=white\" width=\"129\" height=\"28\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/bagofholding/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/about.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">儲物袋</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">為《我的世界》帶來了恰到好處的魔法便攜式儲存功能。將隨身物品裝進時尚的袋子中，隨時隨地輕鬆存取，大幅減少整理雜亂背包的時間。🎒</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">可於三種不同等級的袋子間選擇，容量依次遞增，從小巧的皮製錢包到能容納整座建築材料的巨大金袋應有盡有。可直接在快捷欄打開袋子，或在背包介面內無縫操作。✨</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">靈感來自現代的「捆綁」機制，本模組讓你能瀏覽內容、放入物品、精確取出所需物品，並無需頻繁開啟獨立選單即可管理儲存空間。強大的工具提示預覽與直覺的操作控制，讓每個袋子都使用快速且便捷。🎯</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">對於重視自身物品的冒險者而言，袋子甚至可附魔 </span><em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">保存</span></em><span style=\"font-size:14px\">，使其在死亡時得以保留（需消耗附魔等級）。💎</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/bagofholding/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/features.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🎒 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">三種袋子等級：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">製作皮革、鐵與黃金袋子，容量依次提升以滿足你的需求。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">📦 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">基於背包的儲存存取：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">無需打開專屬介面，即可直接從袋子中放入或取出物品。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🔍 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">詳細內容預覽：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">直接在物品工具提示中查看已儲存的內容，輕鬆一瞥掌握每個袋子裡裝了什麼。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🎯 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">選擇任意已存物品：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">使用滾輪或鍵盤方向鍵，精確選擇想要操作的已存物品。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">📝 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">已選物品詳情：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">瀏覽袋子內容時，即時顯示當前已選物品的相關資訊。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&harr;️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">快速物品傳輸：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">利用直覺的背包互動方式，快速放入或取出物品。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🖱️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">跨多個槽位拖曳：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">點擊並拖曳跨越多個背包槽位，批量放入或取出物品，大幅提升管理效率。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🎚️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">精確物品移動：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">按住 </span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Control</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 鍵（Mac 為 </span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Command</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 鍵），改為移動單一物品而非整組，精準控制傳輸數量。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">💡 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">智慧相容性指示：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">視覺提示會顯示手持物品能否放入，以及內部是否已有相符物品。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🪄 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">專屬袋子介面：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">需要傳統儲存畫面時，可直接從快捷欄打開袋子介面。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🛡️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">保存附魔：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">為袋子附魔「保存」，防止其在死亡時掉落遺失。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⚙️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">高度可自訂：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">可自訂儲存容量、互動方式、控制設定、工具提示行為與視覺效果，完美契合你的遊玩風格。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/bagofholding/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/media.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/bagofholding/media/1.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/bagofholding/media/2.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/bagofholding/media/3.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/bagofholding/media/4.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/bagofholding/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/installation.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">客戶端與伺服器皆必須安裝</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">需要安裝 </span></strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/puzzles-lib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">PUZZLES LIB</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> (FABRIC &amp; NEOFORGE)</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">需要安裝 </span></strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">FABRIC API</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> (FABRIC)</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">需要安裝 </span></strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/forge-config-api-port-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">FORGE CONFIG API PORT</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> (FABRIC)</span></strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/bagofholding/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/configuration.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">若模組支援，可直接透過遊戲內的模組選單進行設定（Fabric 版需安裝由 Prospector 開發的 Mod Menu）。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">若欲使用外部文字編輯器進行手動設定，所有檔案均位於 </span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">.minecraft/config</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 目錄下。檔名依配置類型分別為 </span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">MOD_ID-client.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">、</span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">MOD_ID-common.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">或</span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">MOD_ID-server.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">。並非所有模組都會具備全部類型的設定檔。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/bagofholding/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/credits.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size:14px\">感謝 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/rwtema\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">RWTema</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 啟發本模組，其靈感源自他們舊版《</span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/extra-utilities\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Extra Utilities</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\">》模組中的儲物袋道具。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size:14px\">衷心感謝 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/nyffuuuh23\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Nyffuuuh23</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 製作了這些精美的材質！</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/bagofholding/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<table style=\"text-align:center\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/effect-insights\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/effectinsights/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/easy-anvils\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easyanvils/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/new-shroomcraft\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/shroomcraft/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cut-through\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/cutthrough/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/stonecutting-upgrade\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/stonecuttingupgrade/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/horse-expert\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/horseexpert/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/universal-bone-meal\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/universalbonemeal/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/name-tag-upgrade\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/nametagupgrade/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/leaves-be-gone\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/leavesbegone/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pick-up-notifier\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/pickupnotifier/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/bagofholding/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flunapixel.studio%252fdiscord\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/studio.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/bagofholding/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>",
